From d011eec8c10f5078fe9e45a58873d58e56355d71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:20:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Host share images in private channel and expose board link
 fields

Upload share PNGs to SHARE_CHANNEL_ID instead of DMing the user. On
guess/finish, store shareImageUrl plus stringName/discordName on
channelProgress and return them from /channel-progress for clickable
board links.
---
 env.d.ts                      |  1 +
 src/api/share.ts              | 43 ++++++++++++------------
 src/app/Activity4.tsx         | 61 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 src/convex/channelProgress.ts | 22 ++++++++++---
 src/convex/http.ts            |  5 ++-
 src/convex/schema.ts          |  8 ++++-
 6 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

